# Intent Semantic Upgrade Plan

This plan outlines a rigorous, scenario-driven approach to upgrading our intent resolution system. We will shift from simple deterministic variations to situation-aware semantic mapping.

## Proposed Process

For each intent (selected by the user), we will follow this strict sequence:

### 1. Intent Selection & Scenario Generation
The user picks the target intent. Without reviewing existing variations, I will generate 20 diverse "scenarios" (situations or triggers) that lead to this intent.

### 2. Variation Pruning and Relocation
- Analyze [bench.json](file:///c:/Users/chatz/Downloads/eCommerce/be3_ai/src/services/intentResolver/semanticLab/intents/joint_bench.json) for the selected intent.
- Identify variations that fit better under a different intent.
- Move these "misaligned" variations to their appropriate [bench.json](file:///c:/Users/chatz/Downloads/eCommerce/be3_ai/src/services/intentResolver/semanticLab/intents/joint_bench.json) files.

### 3. Scenario-Variation Alignment
- Evaluate remaining variations against the 20 generated scenarios.
- Fill coverage gaps by adding new variations.
- Ensure all variations use "African Style Simple English" (natural phrasing, no pidgin).

### 4. Configuration Review
- Check `config.json` in `C:\Users\chatz\Downloads\eCommerce\be3_ai\src\services\intentResolver\config\intents`.
- Adjust thresholds or parameters to match the refreshed semantic scope.

### 5. Documentation and Verification
- Create a `walkthrough.md` summarizing the changes.
- Provide proof of verification (e.g., successful resolution of new variations).

### 6. Handoff
Wait for user permission before proceeding to the next intent.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `intentResolver` tests (if available) to ensure no regressions.
- Verify that the new "African Style" variations correctly trigger the target intent with high confidence.

### Manual Verification
- Review the pruned and relocated variations to ensure they now reside in the most semantically accurate bucket.
